      "message": "Ha. I spent a couple of hours on that. Turns out it\u0027s a real pain, because we\u0027re all used to seeing the output in alphabetical order, column-first:\n\n  aaa  ddd  ggg\n  bbb  eee  hhh\n  ccc  fff\n\nPrinting it in that order requires looking ahead, and when the restricted commands are scattered randomly among the non-restricted ones (all in alphabetical order), looking ahead adds a non-trivial amount of code.\n\nThe alternatives are to change the order:\n\n  aaa  bbb  ccc\n  ddd  eee  fff\n  ggg  hhh\n\nor to show them all. Showing them all is a lot easier.",
